      "schemaVersion": 1,
      "installation": "Install the Night and Paper flavors from this repository's root-level flavor directories:\n\n```sh\nya pkg add living-code-theme/yazi:living-code-night\nya pkg add living-code-theme/yazi:living-code-paper\n```\n\nUse `living-code-frost` or `living-code-signal` instead for another dark flavor. Then configure `~/.config/yazi/theme.toml`:\n\n```toml\n[flavor]\ndark = \"living-code-night\"\nlight = \"living-code-paper\"\n```\n\nFor a manual install, copy a complete `living-code-<flavor>.yazi` directory into Yazi's `flavors` directory. On Windows it is `%AppData%\\yazi\\config\\flavors`.",
      "configuration": "See [yazi's documentation](https://yazi-rs.github.io) for application settings and reload behavior. The activation instructions above identify each supported flavor; keep your other application configuration.",
      "compatibility": "This port supplies theme files for yazi, not the application itself. Install the application separately and follow the installation instructions for its supported configuration format.",
